<title>USA: Rayonier stake sold by ADM. [corrected 18:45 gmt]</title>
<headline>Rayonier stake sold by ADM. [corrected 18:45 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Archer Daniels Midland said Tuesday it had sold all of its 2,190,400 (corrects from 10,981,600) common shares of Rayonier Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, ADM said it sold the stake between November 27 and December 6 at $38 to $39.25 per share.</p>
<p>ADM, a processor of agricultural products for the food and feed industries, did not give a reason for selling the stock in the timber products company.</p>
</text>
